Source: spellbk.inc
     1 				; Dictionary table access for the spell checker. Lives in the resident code below $4000, outside the
     2 				; $4000-$7FFF window of the 130XE extended bank, so it stays visible while the bank is switched in.
     3 				; Interrupts are masked (NMIEN off) while the bank is mapped because the code at $4000-$4BFF is hidden then.
     4
